   "id": "y93-maxwell-record",
   "kind": "milestone",
   "headline": "Mad Max Passes McCoy and Takes the Career Rushing Record",
   "dek": "Ryland Maxwell ran for 2,145 yards in Y93 and finished at 25,701, 1,194 clear of Lane McCoy. The record board now carries his name for career rushing touchdowns as well.",
   "body": [
    "A year ago Ryland Maxwell sat 951 yards behind Lane McCoy on the career rushing list. McCoy did not play in Y93, and Maxwell did not slow down. He ran for 2,145 yards and 26 touchdowns in all 20 of Philadelphia's games, caught 23 passes for 10 more scores, and finished the season with 25,701 career rushing yards, the most on file and 1,194 ahead of McCoy.",
    "The record board kept by Skura's clubs now lists him for both career rushing marks: 25,701 yards and 355 touchdowns. The second is a club record only. Across the whole league McCoy's 458 rushing touchdowns still stand first.",
    "The market moved with him again. His Career Legacy rose from 11,001 to 11,965, past Rondale Ikarras at 11,725, so no running back on file now rates higher. His card's value climbed from 29,409 to 33,647. He is 33, he has 10 rings, every one of them won with Skura across three clubs, and he has 5 Super Bowl MVPs."
   ],
