  {
   "id": "y93-record-chases",
   "kind": "chase",
   "headline": "Hainsey Closes In on Two Career Records, and Bello Is a Sack From Suh",
   "dek": "Odell Hainsey is 2 interceptions behind Damar Hobbs and 196 tackles behind K'Lavon Settle. Deshone Bello needs 1 sack to tie Kalif Suh.",
   "body": [
    "Damar Hobbs took the career interceptions record a year ago and did not play in Y93. His 43 now have company in the rear-view mirror. Odell Hainsey of the Chargers intercepted 4 passes and made 183 tackles in 17 games, and he has 41 interceptions and 2,989 tackles for his career: 2 short of Hobbs and 196 short of K'Lavon Settle's career tackles record of 3,185. At 34, his overall still rose from 94 to 97.",
    "Deshone Bello of the Jets had 3 sacks, tied for the most in the league, and has 23 for his career, 1 behind Kalif Suh's league record of 24.",
    "Further down the lists, Siran Spector of the Texans ran for 24 touchdowns and has 373, 1 behind Rondale Ikarras for fifth on the career list. Kyron Atwell made 199 tackles for the Jets and now has 2,853. Lane McCoy, who did not play this season either, still holds the career rushing touchdowns record at 458."
   ],
